There's no one way to do GSB experience.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.870
There is so much support and
resources provided to help

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:04.970
everybody realize their GSB social life,
that they want it to be.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:08.300
That was a pleasant surprise, I would say.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.040
Very good, yeah.

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:17.420
